{"id":1637,"skill":"listening","title":"KT furniture","type":2,"quizType":3,"durationMin":60,"thumbnail":"9aabd2c4-bbdc-488e-8ce6-10c5a48e95db","thumbnailUrl":"/assets/thumbs-listening/1637.jpg","totalSubmitted":6357,"voteCount":8,"isPublic":true,"quizCode":"","dateUpdated":"2026-05-08T12:59:10.012242+07:00","tags":[{"id":35,"code":"section_1","title":"Section 1"},{"id":6,"code":"FILL_BLANK","title":"Gap Filling"}],"parts":[{"id":1719,"index":1,"title":"","transcriptHtml":"<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Good afternoon, KT Furniture. can I help you?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Oh, hello, yes, um. I'm setting up a new office and I don't have internet access yet, but I'd like to place an order for some furniture.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> That's fine. You can do it over the phone, and I can fill in the form for you this end.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Oh great, thanks</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> I just need to take a few customer details first. if that's OK?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Yes, fine.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> What name is it?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> My name?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Yes.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Oh, it's Sue Brown</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Sue Brown - thanks.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">And what's the name of your company, Ms Brown?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> It's a clothing company, er, it's called 'Dress your best'.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> {[OK. I'll just note that down... 'Dress- for- best'.][1]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> {[No - 'your best'.][1]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Oh right. got it. So you make smart clothes?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Yes, formal dress for weddings and special occasions. We also repair and alter clothes.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> I see. And where are you located - what's your postal address?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Right -- well, we're on {[Kirby Trading Estate.][2]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Kirby - how do you spell that?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> It's K-i-R-B-Y.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Oh. I know that area. It's New Hampton Road, isn't it?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Yes, that's right, number 210 - in South Down.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK, and can I have a contact number for our delivery man?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Sure - it's probably best if I give you my mobile number</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> The number's {[09356 788 545.][3]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK ... double 7 8 ...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> No - 7 double 8. 5-4-5.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Ah ... OK, that's great. Now, just a couple more questions before I take your order ...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Fine.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> We have two delivery dates this month. and you should be able to have either.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> When are they?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Well, there's one on the 16th of the month, but there's a charge of 40 dollars for that one.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Oh. that's a lot!</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Mmm. Or there's option 2, which is the end of the month. . . I'll have to confirm the date later... and that's a free delivery.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> {[I'll take option 2, thanks, I don't want to pay a charge.][4]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK - I'll note down 'no charge'.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> We haven't organised the office yet, so there should be plenty of time.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Mm-hm. And lastly, you don't have an account with us ... so how would you like to pay?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Oh - I'll pay by credit card.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK - will that be Visa?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> {[Is American Express OK?][5]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> {[Absolutely fine.][5]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">(Pause)</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> So - what would you like to order?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Well. I've been looking in your catalogue, and you have some office chairs that look very comfortable for our type of work.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Is there an item code?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Yes, it's ASP 23.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> {[OK - those chairs come in pink, white and black.][6]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> {[Yes, the pink looks nice. but I think the darker colour's better for us][6]} - you can see light materials on it more easily.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> That's true.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> We'll have five of those. I think.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK. I've got that. Anything else?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Do you have any striped mats?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> I'm sorry, not at the moment - they're out of stock. We should have some in next month.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Never mind. Um ... {[Well, um, I'd also like two of your glass desks.][7]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> They're lovely, aren't they?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Yes - you seem to have two sizes.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Basically large or small ... I think the code for the small ones is ...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> {[I think we'll have the large ones - the code here is TG 586.][8]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK, so that's two glass desks. Any lamps for those?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> No - we have to get special lamps for our work.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Oh. I see. Do you have another supplier for those?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Yes ... um, we do need some furniture for our customers, though.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK - for a waiting area or something?</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Well, we have to discuss the work with them. so we need a nice sofa ...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Something soft and ...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> I thought leather ...</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Ah yes, a good choice.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> There's a three-seater here - DFD 44. That seems to be in red, cream or chocolate brown.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> {[Yes. It does come in yellow as well.][9]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> {[Yellow ... Mmm. I'd thought of red ... but ... that sounds lively -- yes,][9]} I'll have that colour. I think brown's a bit too dull, and cream shows the dirt too much.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> Yeah, you're right. Anything else? {[A coffee table, perhaps?][10]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> {[Yes, I think so. Maybe TX 22, the silver one.][10]}</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> A very good choice.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Woman:</strong> Well, that's it. I think.</p>\n<p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\"><strong>Man:</strong> OK ... I'll just add that up for you and then take your credit -card details ...</p>","transcriptSegments":[{"paragraph":0,"sentenc